-- 0016_role_templates_boards: re-seeds role_templates after extending the catalog with aliases and roles seen on Czech
-- job boards on 2026-10-09 (13 new templates, Czech gendered and board-style aliases on existing ones).
--
-- Project: oldboys — goal-conditioned, sourced deep research on a person or company (Apify hackathon)
-- Module:  migrations/0016_role_templates_boards.sql
-- Deps:    D1 (SQLite), role_templates (0013)
